m-Sworn","text":"Triggering a reaction grants the party 20% DMG Bonus and 20% ATK for 12s."},{"name":"Flute of Ezpitzal","text":"Craftable DEF% sword and using Skill raises DEF further."},{"name":"Skyrider Sword","text":"Budget Energy Recharge stat stick."}],"a":[{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Her strongest general support set. Grants a large Elemental DMG Bonus when she triggers the right Crystallize reaction.","stats":"ER%/DEF % · DEF% · Healing%/DEF%"},{"names":["Archaic Petra"],"text":"A situational alternative when another teammate already uses Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City.","stats":""},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Cheap 4-star option giving the team 120 Elemental Mastery after a reaction.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Rock & Burn","members":["Xilonen","Mavuika","Citlali","Bennett"],"text":"Xilonen reduces enemy resistance and buffs damage. Mavuika deals damage while Citlali supports reactions and Bennett boosts ATK.","roles":["Support","DPS","Shield","Support"]},{"name":"Water Works","members":["Xilonen","Neuvillette","Furina","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Neuvillette leads while Furina boosts damage. Xilonen reduces resistance and heals, and Kazuha adds grouping and Hydro buffs.","roles":["Healer / Shred","Main DPS","Hydro Buff","Anemo Buff"]},{"name":"Rock Bottom","members":["Xilonen","Navia","Mavuika","Bennett"],"text":"Navia is the main damage dealer. Xilonen provides Geo support, Mavuika supplies Pyro and damage, and Bennett heals and buffs ATK.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Budget Impact","members":["Xilonen","Gaming","Kaeya","Bennett"],"text":"Gaming drives damage with Pyro Plunging Attacks. Kaeya provides Cryo, Bennett heals and buffs ATK, and Xilonen adds resistance reduction.","roles":["Healer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Cryo Enabler","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Scroll Buffer + Healer: Provide RES shred, Scroll buffs and healing to elemental carries.\nFavonius Team Battery: Trade signature buffing for extra team particles.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support"],"about":"Xilonen is a versatile Geo support who shreds enemy RES while providing strong healing and team buffs. She fits into a huge variety of teams thanks to her low field time and excellent support utility.","pros":["Strong RES Shred","Powerful Healing","Low Field Time","Flexible Teammate","Easy to Build"],"cons":["Team Comp Restrictions","Limited Mono-Geo Synergy","Healing Burst Reliant"],"weapons":["Peak Patrol Song","Favonius Sword","Freedom-Sworn","Flute of Ezpitzal","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Archaic Petra"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["ER% / DEF %","DEF%","Healing% / DEF%"],"stats":["DEF: 2,000–2,500+ (3,200 with signature)","Energy Recharge: 160–200% as needed"],"vars":[{"title":"Scroll Buffer + Healer","role":"Support","weapons":["Peak Patrol Song","Favonius Sword","Flute of Ezpitzal"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"DEF% and ER; Healing Bonus optional.","teams":"Two or more eligible Pyro/Hydro/Electro/Cryo samples for healing.","when":"Provide RES shred, Scroll buffs and healing to elemental carries.","cond":"Healing requirements depend on team element samples.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Favonius Team Battery","role":"Support","weapons":["Favonius Sword","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Archaic Petra"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"CRIT Rate for Favonius, enough ER and DEF.","teams":"Energy-hungry teams with relevant elemental reactions.","when":"Trade signature buffing for extra team particles.","cond":"Favonius triggers from CRIT hits while on-field.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Prithiva Topaz Sliver","Prithiva Topaz Fragment","Prithiva Topaz Chunk","Prithiva 